######################################################
# FINAL RESULTS
######################################################

### Get Final Personality Result
GET {{baseUrl}}/personality/a56535c3-5607-4f13-877b-49ed0f39125a/final
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### Get Final Personality Report access by owner
GET {{baseUrl}}/personality/a56535c3-5607-4f13-877b-49ed0f39125a/report
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### Get Final Personality Report access by admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/personality/a56535c3-5607-4f13-877b-49ed0f39125a/report
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get Final Personality Report access by admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/personality/a56535c3-5607-4f13-877b-49ed0f39125a/report
